is) هو طائر ينتمي إلى فصيلة ببغاوات العالم القديم."]},"enwiki":"Rosy-faced lovebird","image":{"file":"162 Rosy-faced lovebird in flight in Damaraland Photo by Giles Laurent.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/00/162_Rosy-faced_lovebird_in_flight_in_Damaraland_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/162_Rosy-faced_lovebird_in_flight_in_Damaraland_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg/960px-162_Rosy-faced_lovebird_in_flight_in_Damaraland_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:162_Rosy-faced_lovebird_in_flight_in_Damaraland_Photo_by_Giles_Laurent.jpg","author":"Giles Laurent","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","origin":null},"audio":null,"audioFromSearch":false,"video":null},{"id":"Q1144584","ar":"متيم ليليان","sci":"Agapornis lilianae","en":"Lilian's Lovebird","iucn":"NT","wdrev":2534000792,"head":"متيم","root":null,"arwiki":{"title":"متيم ليليان","rev":69732322,"text":["مُتَيَّم ليليان أو ببغاء الحب لِليليان (الاسم العلمي: Agapornis lilianae)، هو نوع من الطيور يتبع جنس المتيم ضمن فصيلة ببغاوات العالم القديم من رتبة الببغاوات. يبلغ طوله نحو 13 سم. يتغذى على حبوب النباتات والأعشاب والفواكه."]},"enwiki":"Lilian's lovebird","image":{"file":"Nyasa.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/Nyasa.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/Nyasa.jpg","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nyasa.jpg","author":"Agapornis5","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":null,"origin":null},"audio":null,"audioFromSearch":false,"video":null},{"id":"Q286299","ar":null,"sci":"Bolbopsittacus lunulatus","en":"Guaiabero","iucn":"LC","wdrev":2560643140,"head":null,"root":null,"arwiki":null,"enwiki":"Guaiabero","image":{"file":"29 GUAIABERO PARROT.jpg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/29_GUAIABERO_PARROT.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/common